%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-06 §"Content Selection Algorithm" 8-step pipeline (no sequenceDiagram in spec for this endpoint).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SafetyService
    participant ContentService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Redis

    SafetyService->>ContentService: POST /internal/v1/content/select {category, ageBand, childProfileId, parentToggles}
    ContentService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT active+approved templates WHERE category=? AND ageBand IN (...)
    PostgreSQL-->>ContentService: candidate pool
    alt parent_toggle_disabled_all
        Note over ContentService: every candidate disabled by parent_toggles
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: 409 no_eligible_template
    else no_candidates_after_filter
        ContentService->>Redis: HGET content:cooldown:{childProfileId} (24h TTL)
        Redis-->>ContentService: cooldown set
        ContentService->>ContentService: drop cooldown + exclusions
        Note over ContentService: zero candidates remain — exhaustion path
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: 409 no_eligible_template
    else exhaustion_recovery_required
        ContentService->>Redis: HGET content:cooldown:{childProfileId}
        Redis-->>ContentService: cooldown set
        ContentService->>ContentService: filter cooldown + exclusions — empty
        ContentService->>Redis: HDEL 5 oldest cooldowns (least TTL first)
        Redis-->>ContentService: cleared 5
        ContentService->>ContentService: refilter, topic boost, weighted random
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT content_delivery_events row
        ContentService->>Redis: HSET content:cooldown:{childProfileId} templateId EX 86400
        ContentService-)ContentService: emit cp-retrieval-analytics
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {templateId, templateText, variationInstruction}
    else redis_unavailable_skip_cooldown
        ContentService->>Redis: HGET cooldowns
        Redis--xContentService: error
        Note over ContentService: degrade — proceed without cooldown filter, emit degraded metric
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT content_delivery_events degraded=true
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {templateId, templateText, variationInstruction}
    else success
        ContentService->>Redis: HGET content:cooldown:{childProfileId}
        Redis-->>ContentService: cooldown set
        ContentService->>ContentService: filter + topic boost (cap 2.0x) + weighted random
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT content_delivery_events (append-only)
        ContentService->>Redis: HSET content:cooldown:{childProfileId} templateId EX 86400
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {templateId, templateText, variationInstruction}
    end
    Note over SafetyService,Redis: invariants — cooldown bypass only on exhaustion — disabled templates never selected — age band hard filter
